B.bek=new A.d3("Pung Mutita","\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50 \u0e40\u0e22\u0e35\u0e48\u0e22\u0e21\u0e21\u0e32\u0e01 Highly recommended! As a Thai traveler visiting the Philippines for the first time, I wanted to make the most of my Cebu trip with an itinerary tailored to my interests. I planned everything on short notice and wanted to include freediving, explore the mountains, visit a local night market, and choose my own accommodations. That\u2019s when I found Spoony Cebu Travel and Tours, and I\u2019m so glad I did! The admin was quick to respond, helpful, and full of great recommendations. Even when I had trouble with international bank transfers, they genuinely tried to help me find a solution. I really appreciated their flexibility and willingness to accommodate my plans. Since some days were dedicated to full-day freediving trips, the team adjusted the transportation arrangements to fit our schedule. Everything worked out well, and I was happy to have the freedom to plan the trip my way. A special shout-out to Kuya Christian, our driver!! He was funny, friendly, and always helpful. He shared local tips, helped carry our belongings, and took photos for us. My favorite part was having him show us around the night market and introduce us to delicious local food. We had such a great time. Oh, and he\u2019s a pretty good singer too\ud83d\ude06\ud83d\ude97 Thanks to the Spoony team, our first trip to the Philippines was such a memorable one. We had a great time in Cebu.  \u0e02\u0e2d\u0e1a\u0e04\u0e38\u0e13\u0e04\u0e48\u0e30\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83c\uddf9\ud83c\udded\ud83e\udef6\ud83c\udffb\ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\udded","October 2026","Custom Cebu Itinerary")
B.bee=new A.d3("MJ Villanueva","Good morning po. \ud83c\udf1e\ud83d\ude00 Thank you so much po for accommodating us and for the tour, it was absolutely the best! Even though our time was limited, we enjoyed every moment so much. Our driver was very approachable, friendly, and truly made the trip better. Everything went smoothly, and we had such a wonderful experience. We\u2019ll definitely recommend this (page) to our friends and looking forward to booking again! \u2728\ud83e\udd70","August 2026",null)
B.be4=new A.d3("Katherine Palmario","Highly recommended! Shoutout to Kuya Vincent, our driver/tour guide for our city tour. He shared lots of interesting trivia about Cebu, and a safe driver. He definitely made our trip more memorable! \ud83d\udcaf","June 2026","City Tour")
B.be8=new A.d3("Ivy C. Arguelles","Super highly recommended. Hi po Spoony Cebu. Thank you so much po for making our Cebu Trip enjoyable and fun. The private tour for Day 1 (June 28, 2026) is really fun and we\u2019ve learned so much from Kuya Vincent po about Cebu. He\u2019s been our Driver/Tour guide/Photographer. Ang gaganda ng mga shots. Kudos to you Kuya. \ud83e\udef6\ud83c\udffb Our Day 2 (June 29) is memorable since we\u2019ve met new friends as part of the joiners. The water activities are great. Thank you also to Kuya Christian for the safe driving. Our Cebu trip is tiring but so worth it po. \ud83d\udc95 Continue to offer good service po. More power. Thank you so much po ulit. \u2764\ufe0f","June 2026","Private & Joiner Tour")
B.bdU=new A.d3("Anitsirc Sabasalab","Highly recommendable. First, fast ang transaction, on time ang pick up. Mabait ang driver and enjoy during travel maypa videoke pa.","June 2026",null)
B.beo=new A.d3("Karla","Highly recommended! Thank you Spoony Cebu Travel and Tours for the smooth 6 days trip. Plus a very accomodating and fun to be with tour guide Sir Vincent. He was a family to us during our 6 days trip with him. \u2764\ufe0f","May 2026","6-Day Trip")
B.bed=new A.d3("Jannah Jessever Alora","Of all the tours we had, Spoony Cebu Travel and Tours was the best!! We had the most amazing tour guides!! Shoutout for Kuya Vincent for literally driving us from North to South for 3 days straight. You are highly recommended super fun and entertaining. Will never forget the funniest tour guides for our canyoneering experience, parang di kami napagod sa kakatawa and how you constantly check up on us. We felt super safe and secured. Literally never a dull moment for the whole trip!! Also for Sir Rodjen, for accommodating all of my questions and making our whole tour possible. You\u2019re missing out if hindi sila ang pinili niyong travel and tours!! Super worth it!! Will surely go back and will definitely choose them again to accommodate us. Thank you and praying for the growth of your business!! More tour packages to come!! \ud83e\ude77","May 2026","3-Day North to South")
B.be1=new A.d3("Lourielle Dianne","\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50 Last minute, decided to go on tour as a solo joiner. Had an amazing experience with the Oslob- Sumilon day tour package! Everything was well-organized from start to finish. The service was excellent, and our tour guide was incredibly kind, friendly, and knowledgeable\u2014making the whole trip even more enjoyable. We got to visit so many beautiful places, and every part of the tour was smooth, fun, and memorable. You can really tell they care about giving guests the best experience possible. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a hassle-free and unforgettable travel adventure","March 2026","Oslob\u2013Sumilon Day Tour")
B.bdY=new A.d3("Bernarose A. Villegas","super accommodating, love the environment","March 2026",null)
B.beh=new A.d3("Rene Sunga","thanks eman at Vincent sa maingat nyo pag dadrive at pag antabay samin,sana palagi kayo gabayan ng puon sainyong trabaho","March 2026",null)
B.be2=new A.d3("RC Sun","Many thanks to Spoony Cebu Travel and Tours for a smooth and stress-free Cebu city tour and Moalboal-Kawasan tour. Great service from Kuya Emman and Kuya Vincent, very professional, kind and fun drivers and guide. Thank you for your help. Surely will recommend!","March 2026","City & Moalboal\u2013Kawasan")
B.bdX=new A.d3("Ruby Naomi Millamina","Super safe and accomodating \ud83d\ude4f salamat po kay kuya vincent sa pag picture at video samin! Sa uulitin po \ud83d\ude0a","February 2026",null)
B.be7=new A.d3("Kristel Dane","Napakagandang experience kasama ang Spoony Travel and Tours \u2014 at second time ko na ito sa kanila kaya masasabi kong consistent talaga ang galing at serbisyo! \ud83d\udcaf Mula umpisa hanggang dulo, maayos, organisado, at ramdam ang malasakit sa mga biyahero. Lalo na ang aming driver, photographer, videographer, at human drone na si Mark Vincent Branoco \u2014 sobrang solid! \ud83d\udc4f\ud83d\udd25 Hindi lang mahusay magmaneho, kundi napakahusay din kumuha ng litrato at video. Sulit na sulit bawat kuha, bawat angle, at bawat moment. Talagang lodi ka! \ud83d\ude4c Maraming salamat, Spoony Travel and Tours, sa isa na namang masaya, safe, at memorable na biyahe. Second time pa lang pero siguradong hindi ito ang huli! Highly recommended! \ud83c\udf0f\u2728 PS. Napatiktok din naman si Kuya Driver hehehe","January 2026",null)
B.be9=new A.d3("Avigail Joyce Andrade Cabral","Highly recommended! 10/10 ang aming naging experience \u2764\ufe0f Sobrang saya at smooth ng naging travel namin. Ang babait din ng drivers at sila na rin mismo nagpipicture sa inyo. Super worth it! \ud83d\udc96","January 2026",null)
B.bem=new A.d3("Fjh Monil","Great service and very affordable\ud83e\udd17\ud83e\udd17\ud83e\udd17","December 2025",null)
B.bea=new A.d3("Shaillaine Alones","Easy transaction and budget friendly! Much recommended po \ud83d\ude0a God bless! \ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffd","October 2025",null)
B.be3=new A.d3("RoseMarie Pelobello","Thank you Spoony Cebu for the hassle free and budget-friendly tour, very accommodating and friendly din ng mga driver sa tour. Highly recommended!","September 2025",null)
B.bdW=new A.d3("Angel Adaya","Highly recommended \ud83d\udcaf Daghang salamat Spoony and Sir Junjun sa smooth nga byahe ug makalingaw na experience during our 3D2N Cebu trip. Even the accommodations kay di gyud kamahayan, nindot ug limpyo (plus points na naay heater aron di mapasmo human sa laag hahaha) Until our next trip po! God bless and more powers to your business!","September 2025","3D2N Cebu Trip")
B.bel=new A.d3("Syrah Quijano","\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50 We had such a great experience with Spoony Cebu Travel and Tour during our 4-day trip in Cebu (July 22\u201325)! From start to finish, everything was smooth and enjoyable. A special shoutout to Kuya Rodjan and Kuya Junjun, our driver and tour guide \u2014 super friendly, accommodating, and always ready to help us with our little requests. He\u2019s also amazing at taking photos! We loved every shot and appreciated how he made each stop fun and memorable. Spoony Cebu Travel and Tour was very responsive to our inquiries on their page, which gave us peace of mind while planning our trip. As first-time Cebu visitors, our hard-earned money was truly worth it \u2014 thanks to this reliable and thoughtful travel agency. Highly recommended! \ud83d\udc99\ud83d\ude97\u2728","July 2025","4-Day Cebu Trip")
B.bdZ=new A.d3("Shey Nudo","Literal na HASSLE FREE!! \ud83d\ude0d Big thanks to this agency, super happy ng Cebu family trip namin from day 1 to day 4. Very recommended!! \ud83d\udcaf\ud83d\udc4c","July 2025","Family Trip")
B.bes=new A.d3("Christine Coles - Fortes","We had an amazing experience with Spoony Cebu Travel and Tour! Highly recommended for anyone planning to explore Cebu and Bohol. Their 7D6N package is super sulit and very affordable! Shoutout to the awesome team who made our trip extra special: \u2728 Kuya Rodjen \u2013 our ever-reliable organizer who made sure everything was smooth and hassle-free \ud83d\ude97 Kuya John \u2013 our Cebu City tour driver who brought us to the heart of the city \ud83c\udf34 Kuya Jr \u2013 our Bohol tour driver who made the countryside tour unforgettable \ud83c\udf0a Kuya Junjun \u2013 our driver for Oslob and Moalboal who brought us to breathtaking views and experiences These kuyas didn\u2019t just drive us around \u2013 they showed us the real beauty of Cebu and Bohol. In fairness, hindi sila boring kasama (haha), but when it\u2019s time to rest, you\u2019ll get to rest comfortably during the trip. \ud83d\udcaf If kami ang tatanungin, we\u2019d definitely book with them again on our next visit. Thank you, Spoony Cebu Travel and Tour, for a fun, safe, and sulit adventure! \ud83c\udf34\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udc99","July 2025","7D6N Cebu & Bohol")
B.bec=new A.d3("Janella Mae Ebora","Very recommended po itong agency na ito when you\u2019re planning to go to Cebu. Mabilis po sya kausap and very flexible sa gusto mong itinerary and schedule na gawin sa Cebu. Nasulit namin 4D3N tour sa kanila. Sobrang bait and masayahin din ng driver. Shoutout sayo Kuya Junjun na kamuka ni Piolo, miss ka na namin!!! See you soon Kuya \ud83e\udef6\ud83c\udffb","July 2025","4D3N Tour")
B.bep=new A.d3("Belle Vanessa Gutierrez Sarmiento-Madeja","Hassle free & affordable. Highly recommeded! \u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50","March 2025",null)
B.be5=new A.d3("Marielvic Palacio Ababa","Thank you Spoony Cebu Travel and Tour for your se rvice with Kuya Arvin as our guide. highly recommended! Keep it up!","March 2025",null)
B.ber=new A.d3("Lime De Castro Aquino","Highly recommend ... kuddos sa inyo kuya Rodjel and ate rose at sa buong team... safety first at grabe ang babait kasama and chill lang talaga...","March 2025",null)
B.beq=new A.d3("Zen Cui","Highly recommended travel and tour! Sa DIY Travel Philippines group ko sila nakita at hindi naman ako na disappoint na sa kanila ako mag book \ud83d\ude0a Very kind and friendly and mga tour guide and drivers, very cozy ang mga room accommodation na binigay nila for us, 12pax. Sulit na sulit ang 5D4N namin with them \ud83d\ude0d","February 2025","5D4N Group Tour")
B.be0=new A.d3("Ralph John Gomiega","Highly recommended! after booking, ride and enjoy nalang kayo sa tour nyo! Drivers are kind and friendly. Very accommodating! Definitely will book again! Salamat Spoony Cebu Travel and Tour!","October 2024",null)
B.bdV=new A.d3("Bhe Ortega Arapan","Highly recommended!\ud83d\udc4d It was my first time to book a travel tour and Thank God tama yung naging choice ko. Thank you Spoony Cebu Travel and Tour. Super nag-enjoy kami sa aming Cebu trip. Shout out kay Kuya Jun for assisting us and sa pagdrive nya mabilis pero swabe haha\ud83d\ude01 Sa lahat din ng aming mga napuntahan at nameet don through them. Thank you po. Ang babait nila lahat. It was really a best birthday gift to me.\ud83d\ude0a Godbless po and more travel to come.\u2764\ufe0f","June 2024",null)
B.be_=new A.d3("Charise Quillopo","Highly recommended! \ud83d\udcaf Na-enjoy namin ang tour namin sa Cebu and Bohol. Mabait din \u2019yung owner and yung driver/guide namin.","June 2024","Cebu & Bohol Tour")
B.ben=new A.d3("Anna May Aljas Puertos","sulit jud kaayo among Cebu Trip \ud83d\ude0d . highly recommended na tour package","June 2024",null)
B.beg=new A.d3("Chris Bello","Highly Recommended \ud83d\udcaf\ud83e\udef6\ud83c\udffb\u2728 Super nag-enjoy ang family Namin in our 3D2N Exclusive Tour with Spoony! our coordinator, Kuya Nats is super kind, funny and approachable. He made our trip extra special at naging bff Ng papa ko hehehe The van is spacious for 7 pax and our accommodations in Mandaue and Oslob are comfortable and cozy \u2728\ud83e\udef6\ud83c\udffb Worth it going for this tour!","May 2024","3D2N Exclusive Tour")
B.bej=new A.d3("Lesly Dimailig","Highly recommended!! \u2728 Super sulit ng tour!! Ang babait pa nilang lahat!! Na-attach na kami sa mga drivers namin haha, to Kuya Jub na sobrang chill kasama at kay Tatay Fred na super funny \ud83e\udef6\ud83c\udffb To Kuya Rodjen na very hands-on sa lahat ng guests, salute!!","April 2024",null)
B.bei=new A.d3("Alyssa Velasquez","Highly recommended!\ud83e\udef6\ud83c\udffb For joiners tour super affordable! Sobrang cool din ng nag tourguide/driver samin kuya Leeeeeee nag enjoy po kami!!!\ud83d\udcaa Instant human drone \ud83d\ude0e Thank youuu sa smoooth na city tour!\ud83c\udf1d\ud83e\udd17","February 2024","Joiners City Tour")
B.bef=new A.d3("Corazon Abanilla - Sumague","Highly recommended! Their packages are super AFFORDABLE. We avail Cebu-Oslob-Bohol EXCLUSIVE TOUR but it\u2019s much affordable than the others. Thank you so much, Kuya Rodjen!","December 2023","Cebu\u2013Oslob\u2013Bohol Exclusive")
B.beb=new A.d3("Anette Ivann Rivera Santos","Thank you sir rodjen for assisting us in our south cebu and city tour! It was a smooth and fun journey!!!","September 2019","South Cebu & City Tour")
B.be6=new A.d3("Gra Cia","Thank you so much kuya rodjen for a hassle-free transaction and accomodating us even in a last minute. I send him a confirmation in less than 5 hours and will be in mactan airport. And he made to be there in the arrival to pick us up. Definitely I will recommend spoony tour cebu to those who are looking for a land arrangement and tour. He\u2019s making his best to satisfy us in our tour in cebu and bohol. Til next time kuya \ud83d\ude0a","August 2019","Cebu & Bohol Tour")
